<title>BELGIUM: ATHLETICS-EL GUERROUJ SETS INDOOR MILE RECORD.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-EL GUERROUJ SETS INDOOR MILE RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>GHENT, Belgium 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Hicham el Guerrouj set a world indoor mile record of three minutes 48.45 seconds at the Flanders indoor athletics meeting on Wednesday.</p>
<p>El Guerrouj beat the 3:49.78 set by Ireland's Eamonn Coghlan on February 27 1983 in East Rutherford, New Jersey.</p>
